  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-nine-little-cookies-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "97aeced9bb7dd12ba3d05f65514d4df326b675c59b795e17d52c88f310f8ea9b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9b8d09fde7f7142b427fe02d89f96049ed9692ffd31f1ecbeb960e2d310d9345",
      "text": "八戒的九块小饼干",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db6f7938d6779d7582ec5eb4396ece6810bb9067e74b1102147d77b622de6ec1",
      "text": "八戒烤了九块小饼干：\n一、二、三、四、五、\n六、七、八、九！\n每一块都一模一样。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "106e7a659be43871c4d80e07da0ee8951e0daeceb2fe249556b6495a8828849d",
      "text": "悟空和玉兔来做客。\n八戒摆出三只盘子：\n“我们一起分着吃吧！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f41d4cdaaa5fef54c93659215ca99d6e94231f3d52c6620ef01adb0a631c8182",
      "text": "悟空说：“我来分！”\n悟空四块，\n玉兔三块，\n八戒两块。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8cc7cfb6ab1a75bb747852722756128f7c6257d9900e5c0b8e782cb03e4277ef",
      "text": "八戒看看自己的盘子：\n“我的盘子空荡荡的，\n饼干都觉得孤单啦！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b51601b3752b10b3c3a207cfc4f700a84f8e2bc6142e3188c9b9ea391103c6e3",
      "text": "玉兔数了数每只盘子：\n四块、三块、两块。\n她说：“这样不公平，\n我们让每个人都一样多吧。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2758a14467163ab04d4283b9afa282de04d211dde6ca8e457668dd5b325d5598",
      "text": "大家把饼干都放回托盘上，\n还是九块，\n一块也没少。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f86c14dca159b04d68290abcd6db890464b48d88517c28b0f2a412e70b4f55f6",
      "text": "玉兔说：“我们轮流来，\n每只盘子放一块，\n一轮一轮地分。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "03e733e78dd52c4a9005a5ec2a20cea135d3169ab4a74ba23f1e42d46ca31be8",
      "text": "第一轮：\n悟空一块，\n玉兔一块，\n八戒一块。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11e673ac5d3421258d00271c1ddbcf1991b2249c8a73a1961bdbf7fea24e115a",
      "text": "第二轮：\n一块、一块、一块。\n现在每只盘子都有两块。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d212ccf93ca756cd9c4b54efe3853c8f1158efc9c7ae32296799a59011fb661e",
      "text": "第三轮：\n一块、一块、一块。\n托盘空啦！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "561828671dc4345726da655178c44ee37305a3e4e5532993413c0eec08b5488c",
      "text": "大家一起数：\n三块、三块、三块！\n玉兔说：“每个人都有三块，\n一样多，也公平！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ca12a9b76b2da314ae1378b806f7f578cac9f3ddc2f4ee9c66edc01ee9b8f792",
      "text": "八戒把空托盘翻过来看了看：\n“我在找第四只盘子，\n给我的肚子用的！”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45ce195ab57d7e658ce3e759bb49293819ed9cee7cf3557f94d75adbb01be315",
      "text": "玉兔咯咯地笑：\n“没有第四只盘子，\n三只就够啦。”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09bcbd3a5f423d28656d527188a23973544ca1ee71c1f07410176a7923947a69",
      "text": "现在可以吃啦。\n咔嚓、咔嚓、咔嚓！\n每个人都一样多。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "401ec63a1b629a7dc6fcf288f60547acda777be70f57e267bba3007a63ee16ec",
      "text": "三只空盘子排成一排。\n八戒拍拍圆圆的肚子：\n“三块刚刚好！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
